The hook is in .codex/hooks.json: there the agent runs \`npx --yes firescale@0.5.3 hooks run --agent <name>\` before it stops, and keeps working while \`fscale verify\` fails.
The hook starts on this machine: \`npx --yes firescale@0.5.3 --version --json\` answered firescale 0.5.3.
"
`;

